## Booking Confirmation (Requirement 9)
- Always show a Dialog before submitting a booking
- Booking cannot be undone — make this clear in the dialog copy
```tsx
<Dialog>
  <DialogContent>
    <DialogHeader>
      <DialogTitle>{UI.actions.confirm}</DialogTitle>
    </DialogHeader>
    <p>{MESSAGES.confirmBooking}</p>
    <DialogFooter>
      <Button variant="outline" onClick={onCancel}>{UI.actions.cancel}</Button>
      <Button onClick={onConfirm} disabled={isLoading}>{UI.actions.bookNow}</Button>
    </DialogFooter>
  </DialogContent>
</Dialog>
```

## Performance Rules
- All route-level components lazy loaded
- `React.memo` for EventCard in large grids
- `useMemo`/`useCallback` only after profiling confirms a problem
- Explicit image dimensions to avoid layout shift

